# PPS into the FC, logged as a camera feedback edge. What the leg is for, the pad survey,
# and why each of these values: docs/time-base.md, "The FC leg".
#
# Pad S11 = PE5 = GPIO(60).
SERVO11_FUNCTION,-1
CAM1_FEEDBAK_PIN,60
#
# 0 = INTERRUPT_FALLING. The default is 1, the rising edge, which is the wrong one here.
CAM1_FEEDBAK_POL,0
#
# 5 = MAVLINK. No camera is fitted; a non-zero type is what installs the feedback ISR.
CAM1_TYPE,5
